    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc9fADD TO WISHLIST!!\ud83d\udc9f</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835540/extras/a910c08d77109de4d3e520c32542508f.poster.avif?t=1755066943\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835540/extras/a910c08d77109de4d3e520c32542508f.webm?t=1755066943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835540/extras/a910c08d77109de4d3e520c32542508f.mp4?t=1755066943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Kawaii Puzzle: Girl Adventure \ud83c\udf38\ud83d\udc96! It's a blend of puzzle-solving with soothing music and delightful girls.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835540/extras/27accb1c97fc7366e468e5c963c234ed.avif?t=1755066943\" width=616 height=228 /></span><br>\ud83e\udde9 Puzzles: You'll tackle puzzles of varying difficulty to progress and unlock new levels.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835540/extras/b400d4519523a904c425fe2f12702cab.avif?t=1755066943\" width=616 height=228 /></span><br>\ud83d\udc67 Anime Girls: Meet a plethora of colorful anime girls. Collect the entire cast of characters.<br>\ud83d\uddfa Adventure Map: Unlock new levels using earned rewards.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835540/extras/1efd73228ce0f4cdf17400ea9041ecd6.poster.avif?t=1755066943\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835540/extras/1efd73228ce0f4cdf17400ea9041ecd6.webm?t=17550669